 "cards": [
  {
   "dot": "emerald",
   "title": "Main path",
   "items": [
    "The UI only subscribes: runs belong to the gateway and survive reloads and backgrounding",
    "Queued messages wait at the end of the chat; Stop only stops",
    "Claude Code is the official build, byte-for-byte unmodified",
    "Tool calls that need approval show a card; per-call approval by default, as upstream"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "rose",
   "title": "Security",
   "items": [
    "Gateway /api/* requires a 256-bit token; Host and Origin are checked",
    "Signed-in sessions talk to Anthropic directly, never through a local relay",
    "priv only accepts calls from the app's own uid"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Toolchain",
   "items": [
    "devkit is assembled from official Termux packages and relocated in place (same-length prefix)",
    "Entries inside zip/jmod archives are relocated too"
   ]
  },
  {
   "dot": "amber",
   "title": "Component ecosystem",
   "items": [
    "A component adds commands plus a skill, so Claude learns to use them on its own",
    "Community recipes reference Termux packages or upstream files pinned by sha256",
    "CI audits every build and grades it green / amber / red, so humans review only what matters",
    "The app trusts only the ed25519-signed index, which pins every package's sha256"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
